  "known_divergence": "Matrix.copyFrom (Matrix.java:408-424 and Matrix.ts:47-61) maps a 3x3 onto slots 0,1,3 / 4,5,6 / 8,9,10. The second row should map to 4,5,7; writing values[5] into m[6] puts translate-y in the Z column, so a 3x3 constant silently loses its vertical translation. Both engines share the bug, so the expected value below is (7,3,0) — the intended value is (7,10,0)."
